Install dependency:

go get github.com/joho/godotenv

Install driver:

go get github.com/go-sql-driver/mysql

go run ./cmd/server/main.go

Recommendation

সবসময় project root থেকে path সহ run করুন:

go run ./cmd/server




✅ Summary
Postman Body Type	Go Code
x-www-form-urlencoded ✅	r.ParseForm()
form-data ✅	r.ParseMultipartForm()
raw JSON ✅	json.NewDecoder(r.Body).Decode()